#: helpwidget.cpp:64
msgid ""
"<h1>KDE Control Center</h1>Sorry, there is no quick help available for the "
"active control module."
"<br>"
"<br>Click <a href = \"kcontrol/index.html\">here</a> to read the general "
"control center manual."
msgstr ""
"<h1>kde kontrole sentrum</h1>"
"jammer, daar is nee vinnige hulp beskikbaar vir die aktief kontrole "
"module."
"<br>"
"<br>kliek <'n href = \"kcontrol/indeks.html\">hier</'n> aan lees die "
"algemeen kontrole sentrum hand."

